<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Albemarle upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Albemarle upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities Corp said it upgraded its rating on the shares of Albemarle Corp to a buy from a market perform, based on an improving business outlook, new product offerings and valuation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Michael Kostolansky said in a research note the outlook for the company's flame retardant and other underperforming businesses was improving and Albemarle had an impressive array of new product offerings.</p>
<p>-- The company had focused more on cost reduction and its valuation was relatively inexpensive, he said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 19-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
